# The versions that a release is built from. prepare.sh, the Makefile and the
# CI workflows read this file, so a release is one commit that changes it.
#
# cernbox is reva's CLI, built by gaia with the CERNBox CLI plugins and the
# CERNBox brand. Each line is a Go module query: a tag, a commit or a branch.
#
# master is a placeholder. None of the three has a release with what the
# build needs yet: gaia's --binary reva and --brand (cs3org/gaia#6), reva's
# CLI with the HTTP backend and branding (cs3org/reva#5959 to #5963), and the
# CLI plugins with cli/cernbox.toml (cernbox/reva-plugins#88 and T42). Pin
# each one to its release once it is published.
GAIA_VERSION=master
REVA_VERSION=master
REVA_PLUGINS_VERSION=master
